      "vis": false
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Anthropic is making changes to its usage policy for the first time in over a year to reflect new and high-risk cases of misuse — including election interference",
      "y": 978,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 144,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Last August, the company announced it would allow Claude to end conversations with “persistently harmful or abusive” users as part of its research into “model w",
      "y": 1472,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 288,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Beyond the model welfare change, Anthropic has also gathered several “scattered” existing restrictions into a new ban on deceptive commercial or political campa",
      "y": 2110,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 230,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Terminating conversations is still the “primary enforcement mechanism.”",
      "y": 2400,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 68,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Anthropic said that though its usage policy has always publicly banned weapons development using Claude, the company has seen multiple attempts to use Claude to",
      "y": 2498,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 259,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "“Tracking people without their consent is prohibited, whether it happens in real time or through analysis of previously collected data,” Anthropic wrote. “Claud",
      "y": 3157,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 144,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Anthropic states that these rules may be modified for “contracts with certain governmental customers … if, in Anthropic’s judgment, the contractual use restrict",
      "y": 3321,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 115,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Anthropic has seen multiple attempts to use Claude to develop guidance for and control software for weapons.",
      "y": 3496,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 102,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Anthropic also added a new rule that when Anthropic’s AI models are “connected to hardware that takes autonomous physical actions and which might be capable of ",
      "y": 3628,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 202,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Over the past year, Anthropic has repeatedly flirted with the idea that its AI models could be conscious in some way. “Questions about potential internal experi",
      "y": 4230,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 202,
      "vis": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Other parts of the AI industry have been expressly against such ideas. This past September, Microsoft AI’s code of conduct made headlines for taking a firm stan",
      "y": 4452,
      "x": 20,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 230,
      "vis": true
    },
